50,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"We have the Study Commons, Media Center, Path Network, and Lab Ventilation. The Commons fits the demand for general space.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Victoria,,The Path Network is too risky given the weather delays Benjamin mentioned. The Lab Ventilation would disrupt the timetable too much.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The Media Center relies on AV kit, which Kenji noted has no renewal reserve. The Study Commons is the safest bet.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Kenji,,The Lab Ventilation is too expensive now with those tender price hikes. I vote for the Study Commons.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"While I wanted the Lab upgrade for the technicians, the risk of budget and schedule failure seems too high.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"The Study Commons provides the bookable, general-purpose space that the data shows we desperately need.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Victoria,,It's the most rational choice to avoid off-site hiring costs and weather delays.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It avoids the ""comfort project"" slip and the ""outdoor work"" trap.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Kenji,,It's a positive change that won't bankrupt us!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,I can agree to the Commons if it means we don't just ignore the facility's needs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'm voting for Candidate A.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I'm also voting for Candidate A.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,Candidate A is the logical choice.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Kenji,,A it is!,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll go with A as well.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
